  "description": "Fuaran.Compute.Solvers — pinned root finding, one-dimensional minimisation and damped iteration, generic over the caller's problem: a bracketed Newton with a bisection safeguard, bisection, a bracketed integer search, a golden-section minimiser and the accept-or-halve loop of an iteratively reweighted fit, every one stopped by one StoppingRule whose decision is written with + − × ÷ and comparisons alone, in one order, so a solver given pinned functions answers the same bits and stops at the same iteration on .NET, under Fable and in every host that transcribes it. No fused multiply-add and no host mathematics call on any host. FSharp.Core only, nothing of Fuaran.Compute; Fable-clean.",
